msgid "For example,\n"
msgstr "Halimbawa,\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements and configuration {#requirements-and-configuration}"
msgstr "Mga kinakailangan at configuration {#requirements-and-configuration}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following tools are required for the compiling environment:\n"
"* [Rust compiler](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) 1.86 or above\n"
"* A C compiler: for example, GCC (gcc) on Linux and Clang (clang-tools-extra) for Rust unknown targets/cross compilations. QRMI and its SPANK plugin are compatible with a compiler conforming to the C11 standard\n"
"* make/cmake (make/cmake RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
"* openssl (openssl-devel RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
"* zlib (zlib-devel RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
"* Slurm header files(slurm/slurm.h and so forth) must be available on your host\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga sumusunod na tool ay kailangan para sa compiling environment:\n"
"* [Rust compiler](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) 1.86 pataas\n"
"* Isang C compiler: halimbawa, GCC (gcc) sa Linux at Clang (clang-tools-extra) para sa Rust unknown targets/cross compilations. Ang QRMI at ang SPANK plugin nito ay katugma sa isang compiler na sumusunod sa C11 standard\n"
"* make/cmake (make/cmake RPM para sa RHEL-compatible na OS)\n"
"* openssl (openssl-devel RPM para sa RHEL-compatible na OS)\n"
"* zlib (zlib-devel RPM para sa RHEL-compatible na OS)\n"
"* Ang mga Slurm header file (slurm/slurm.h at iba pa) ay dapat available sa iyong host\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The runtime environment requires:\n"
"* gcc (libgcc RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
"* openssl (openssl-libs RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
"* zlib (zlib RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang runtime environment ay nangangailangan ng:\n"
"* gcc (libgcc RPM para sa RHEL-compatible na OS)\n"
"* openssl (openssl-libs RPM para sa RHEL-compatible na OS)\n"
"* zlib (zlib RPM para sa RHEL-compatible na OS)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Configure available quantum resources {#configure-available-quantum-"
"resources}"
msgstr ""
"I-configure ang mga available na quantum resource {#configure-available-"
"quantum-resources}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The repository contains an example configuration "
"([`qrmi_config.json.example`](https://github.com/qiskit-community/spank-"
"plugins/blob/main/plugins/spank_qrmi/qrmi_config.json.example)).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang repository ay naglalaman ng isang halimbawang configuration "
"([`qrmi_config.json.example`](https://github.com/qiskit-community/spank-"
"plugins/blob/main/plugins/spank_qrmi/qrmi_config.json.example)).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `resources` array contains a set of available quantum resources. Each "
"quantum resource definition contains the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang `resources` array ay naglalaman ng isang set ng mga available na quantum"
" resource. Ang bawat kahulugan ng quantum resource ay naglalaman ng "
"sumusunod:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Property | Description |\n"
"| ---- | ---- |\n"
"| name | Quantum resource name (for example, backend name) |\n"
"| type | Resource type (`direct-access`, `qiskit-runtime-service` and `pasqal-cloud`) |\n"
"| environment | A set of environment variables to work with QRMI. Current implementations assume API endpoint and credentials are specified via environment variable setting |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Property | Paglalarawan |\n"
"| ---- | ---- |\n"
"| name | Pangalan ng quantum resource (halimbawa, pangalan ng Backend) |\n"
"| type | Uri ng resource (`direct-access`, `qiskit-runtime-service` at `pasqal-cloud`) |\n"
"| environment | Isang set ng mga environment variable para gamitin sa QRMI. Ipinapalagay ng mga kasalukuyang implementasyon na ang API endpoint at mga kredensyal ay tinukoy sa pamamagitan ng environment variable setting |\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If a user specifies a resource with the `--qpu` option that is not defined "
"in the `qrmi_config.json` file, the specification will be ignored.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung tinukoy ng isang user ang isang resource gamit ang opsyong `--qpu` na "
"hindi naka-define sa `qrmi_config.json` na file, ang tukoy na iyon ay hindi "
"papansinin.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If the user sets the necessary environment variables for job execution "
"themselves, it is not required to specify them in this file. In this case, "
"the environment property will be `{}`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung itatakda ng user mismo ang mga kinakailangang environment variable para"
" sa pagpapatakbo ng job, hindi na kailangang tukuyin ang mga ito sa file na "
"ito. Sa kasong ito, ang environment property ay magiging `{}`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"If you are using a QPU resource with the resource type `qiskit-runtime-service`, use an account that supports [opening a session](/guides/run-jobs-session#open-a-session), such as a Premium Plan account.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Kung gumagamit ka ng QPU resource na may resource type na `qiskit-runtime-service`, gumamit ng account na sumusuporta sa [pagbubukas ng session](/guides/run-jobs-session#open-a-session), tulad ng Premium Plan account.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you are using an account that does not support opening a session, such as an Open Plan account, add `QRMI_IBM_QRS_SESSION_MODE=\"batch\"` to the environment variable list in qrmi_config.json as aworkaround.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung gumagamit ka ng account na hindi sumusuporta sa pagbubukas ng session, tulad ng Open Plan account, magdagdag ng `QRMI_IBM_QRS_SESSION_MODE=\"batch\"` sa listahan ng environment variable sa qrmi_config.json bilang solusyon.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

