"Once you complete installation, you should find the `--qpu=names` option in "
"the `sbatch` help message.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kapag nakumpleto na ang pag-install, makikita mo ang opsyong `--qpu=names` "
"sa `sbatch` help message.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
