msgid "Logging {#logging}"
msgstr "Logging {#logging}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This plugin uses the Slurm logger for logging. Log messages from this plugin"
" can be found in `/var/log/slurm/slurmd.log`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gumagamit ang plugin na ito ng Slurm logger para sa logging. Ang mga log "
"message mula sa plugin na ito ay matatagpuan sa "
"`/var/log/slurm/slurmd.log`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can enable the QRMI runtime log by specifying the following `srun` "
"arguments.\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari mong i-enable ang QRMI runtime log sa pamamagitan ng pagtukoy ng "
"sumusunod na mga `srun` argument.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"|  `sbatch`/`srun` option | Slurm log level (SRUN_DEBUG) | QRMI log level (RUST_LOG) |\n"
"| ---- | ---- | ---- |\n"
"| (default) | 3 | info |\n"
"| `--quiet` | 2 | error |\n"
"| `--verbose` | 4 | debug |\n"
"| `-vv` or more | 5 | trace |\n"
msgstr ""
"|  `sbatch`/`srun` na opsyon | Slurm log level (SRUN_DEBUG) | QRMI log level (RUST_LOG) |\n"
"| ---- | ---- | ---- |\n"
"| (default) | 3 | info |\n"
"| `--quiet` | 2 | error |\n"
"| `--verbose` | 4 | debug |\n"
"| `-vv` o higit pa | 5 | trace |\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Considerations for multiple QPUs {#considerations-for-multiple-qpus}"
msgstr ""
"Mga konsiderasyon para sa maraming QPU {#considerations-for-multiple-qpus}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"At runtime, each QRMI instance is linked to a single QPU resource. To enable"
" the use of multiple quantum resources within a single job script, this "
"plugin sets environment variables with the resource name as a prefix. For "
"example, if `--qpu=qpu1,qpu2` is specified, the environment variables will "
"be set as follows:\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa runtime, ang bawat QRMI instance ay naka-link sa isang solong QPU "
"resource. Para ma-enable ang paggamit ng maraming quantum resource sa loob "
"ng isang job script, itinatakda ng plugin na ito ang mga environment "
"variable na may pangalan ng resource bilang prefix. Halimbawa, kung tinukoy "
"ang `--qpu=qpu1,qpu2`, ang mga environment variable ay itatakda tulad ng "
"sumusunod:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This ensures that each QRMI instance operates with the configuration "
"parameters set for its respective resource during the execution of the Slurm"
" job.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tinitiyak nito na ang bawat QRMI instance ay gumagana gamit ang mga "
"configuration parameter na itinakda para sa kani-kanilang resource sa "
"panahon ng pagpapatakbo ng Slurm job.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The above environment variable settings are applied only to jobs where the "
"`--qpu=names` option is specified.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga setting ng environment variable sa itaas ay inilalapat lamang sa mga"
" job kung saan tinukoy ang opsyong `--qpu=names`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This plugin also sets the following two environment variables, which are "
"referred by the QRMI primitives code.\n"
msgstr ""
"Itinatakda rin ng plugin na ito ang sumusunod na dalawang environment "
"variable, na tinutukoy ng QRMI primitives code.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Environment variable | Description |\n"
"| ---- | ---- |\n"
"| `SLURM_JOB_QPU_RESOURCES` | Comma-separated list of QPU resources to use at runtime. Undocumented resources will be filtered out. For example, `qpu1,qpu2` |\n"
"| `SLURM_JOB_QPU_TYPES` | Comma-separated list of resource type (`direct-access`, `qiskit-runtime-service`, and `pasqal-cloud`). For example, `direct-access,pasqal-cloud` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Environment variable | Paglalarawan |\n"
"| ---- | ---- |\n"
"| `SLURM_JOB_QPU_RESOURCES` | Comma-separated na listahan ng mga QPU resource na gagamitin sa runtime. Ang mga resource na hindi documented ay ifi-filter out. Halimbawa, `qpu1,qpu2` |\n"
"| `SLURM_JOB_QPU_TYPES` | Comma-separated na listahan ng uri ng resource (`direct-access`, `qiskit-runtime-service`, at `pasqal-cloud`). Halimbawa, `direct-access,pasqal-cloud` |\n"
